OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAReform urged to suspend conduct
OL,4,Abreach councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sanctions required Boam to make
OL,7,Fpublic apologies before a Friday
OL,8,Fdeadline, but he said he would not say
OL,9,Fsorry because he did not believe he had
OL,10,Fdone anything wrong. O'Shea said that
OL,11,Frefusal should lead to the whip being
OL,12,Fwithdrawn.
OL,14,FIn response, acting leader of the
OL,15,FReform-led council, Kevin Crook, said:
OL,16,F"I've done all I can locally."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
